    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_art_qn", "x": 431, "y": 436, "width": 230, "height": 168,
      "text": "QN — same space as F1/F3/F4\n\n  0 4 0 3 4 0 0  0 2  0 0 1\n  RR PP  MMM  FF   CCC\n\n  first 9 = the facility\n  last 3  = HCW sequence\n\n  UNIQUE(qn) enforced in MySQL",
      "originalText": "QN — same space as F1/F3/F4\n\n  0 4 0 3 4 0 0  0 2  0 0 1\n  RR PP  MMM  FF   CCC\n\n  first 9 = the facility\n  last 3  = HCW sequence\n\n  UNIQUE(qn) enforced in MySQL",
