    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_risk", "x": 1366, "y": 778, "width": 418, "height": 98,
      "text": "SHARED FATE — never load-tested\nF2 peak: 300–500 concurrent HCWs, 12–15k\nrespondents. Same box, same MySQL as the\nCAPI fleet during Sep rollout. June 22 locked a\nDEDICATED instance; we consolidated instead.",
      "originalText": "SHARED FATE — never load-tested\nF2 peak: 300–500 concurrent HCWs, 12–15k\nrespondents. Same box, same MySQL as the\nCAPI fleet during Sep rollout. June 22 locked a\nDEDICATED instance; we consolidated instead.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400063, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400064, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": "r_risk", "lineHeight": 1.45
    },

    {
      "type": "text", "id": "t_cron", "x": 730, "y": 880, "width": 620, "height": 90,
      "text": "cron on the box\n  ●  nightly csweb_f2 dump + f2-files archive  (19:15 UTC · restore-VERIFIED)\n  ●  auth_kv expiry sweep\n  ●  Sync dashboard regen, every 15 min (now probes f2-api liveness)",
      "originalText": "cron on the box\n  ●  nightly csweb_f2 dump + f2-files archive  (19:15 UTC · restore-VERIFIED)\n  ●  auth_kv expiry sweep\n  ●  Sync dashboard regen, every 15 min (now probes f2-api liveness)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
